location / {
    root /usr/share/nginx/html;
    index index.html index.htm;
    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;

    # Add a custom link to each post
    add_header X-CP-Link "<a href='/post/$uri'>$uri</a>";
}

# ... (rest of the configuration remains the same)
```

In the `location /` block, we're adding a custom header `X-CP-Link` that contains a link to each post. The link is constructed by concatenating the string `"/post/"` with the current URI (`$uri`).

To display this link in your `index.html` file, you can use the following code:
```html
