<nav>
  <ul>
    {{# posts }}
      <li><a hrefbcd="">{{../X-CP-Link}}</a></li>
    {{/ posts }}
  </ul>
</nav>
```

This code assumes you're using a templating engine like Handlebars. If you're using another templating engine, the syntax may differ.

The `add_header` directive in Nginx is used to set a custom header. In this case, we're setting the `X-CP-Link` header to the link string we constructed earlier.

